AVOID=("AVOID: a separate wrapped sarong, skirt, sash, loincloth or any solid plain-cloth garment over the hips (it is the SAME sheer glowing net veil, just DENSER/opaque there, with the net pattern still visible); a HARD edge between the opaque and sheer zones (it is a SMOOTH gradient); the opaque area looking like a different fabric or material from the rest of the veil; a DARK opaque zone or a dark shadow over the hips/thighs while the veil and figure are brightly lit (when the veil is bright the dense zone is a soft LUMINOUS WHITE fade, never dark or grey); a small opaque patch, triangle or brief ONLY at the crotch; a brief, thong, underwear, loincloth or waistband; a sparkling/glittering/bright/glowing groin; a sheer/see-through mask revealing the nose or mouth (the mask is DENSE and OPAQUE over the face); a visible nose or mouth; a blank/shadow-void face (eyes must show); pants, shorts, boots, shoes or footwear (BAREFOOT); a plain smooth cloak with no visible net-weave; a tattered/ragged veil; the veil as just a grid on skin; shallow or barely-curved hook ends (they are DEEP question-mark hooks); the filament-net weave faint, missing, or reduced to a few smooth streaks (it must be a DENSE, clearly VISIBLE glowing web across the whole veil); any refracted copy with EMPTY hands or no weapon (EVERY copy holds an identical The Answer); THE ANSWER as a straight spear/trident/plain sword; a grid or multiple panels; more than one primary figure; caption text, lettering, watermark; single spiral-coil grass; a single un-braided tree trunk; flat low-detail rendering.")
